{"is_source_file": true, "format": "JavaScript", "description": "This file contains the implementation of a TreeView widget within the YAHOO.widget namespace. It defines classes and functions for constructing, managing, and rendering a tree structure in a web page, including features like dynamic loading, event handling, node manipulation (expand, collapse, insert, delete), and styling. The primary class is TreeView, which initializes the tree, provides methods for tree operations, and manages external events. Additionally, there is a base class Node for individual tree nodes, supporting hierarchical relationships, content rendering, and interaction logic.", "external_files": ["YAHOO.util.Dom", "YAHOO.util.Event", "YAHOO.lang", "YAHOO.widget"], "external_methods": ["YAHOO.util.Dom.get", "YAHOO.util.Dom.generateId", "YAHOO.util.Event.on", "YAHOO.util.Event.preventDefault", "YAHOO.util.Event.getTarget", "YAHOO.lang.isString", "YAHOO.lang.isObject", "YAHOO.lang.JSON.parse", "YAHOO.lang.merge", "YAHOO.lang.trim", "YAHOO.widget.Node.prototype.applyParent", "YAHOO.widget.TreeView.prototype.regNode", "YAHOO.widget.TreeView.prototype.fireEvent", "Dom.get", "Dom.replaceClass", "Dom.setStyle", "Dom.getElementsBy", "Dom.addClass", "Dom.removeClass", "Dom.setXY", "Dom.getXY"], "published": ["YAHOO.widget.TreeView", "YAHOO.widget.Node"], "classes": [{"name": "TreeView", "description": "Represents the entire tree widget. Manages nodes, rendering, event handling, and dynamic features. Supports building tree from object or markup, node insertion/removal, expanding/collapsing all nodes, and event subscriptions."}, {"name": "Node", "description": "Base class for individual tree nodes. Handles hierarchical relationships, content HTML generation, state toggling (expand/collapse), and interaction logic, enabling structured navigation within the TreeView."}, {"name": "Node", "description": "Base class for individual tree nodes, supporting hierarchical relationships, content rendering, st